   "evidence": "Tarski.lean:217-219 takes `(hp : p \u2260 0) ... (ha : p.eval a \u2260 0) (hb : p.eval b \u2260 0)`; `p = 0` gives `p.eval a = 0`, contradicting `ha`. Infinity.lean:210-211 takes `(hp : p \u2260 0) (hsimple : \u2200 r, p.eval r = 0 \u2192 p.derivative.eval r \u2260 0)`; with `p = 0`, `hsimple 0` yields `(0 : R) \u2260 0` since `Polynomial.derivative 0 = 0`.",
